  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0260_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "CDAA7F23946301ED",
      "text": "Vous ne pouvez pas faire marche arrière !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0260_system_01",
      "hash64": "9E275C92DC34CA97",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous passer la dernière épreuve\\nde votre examen de maîtrise ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_01",
      "hash64": "E8583ABB962011C9",
      "text": "Je te souhaite la bienvenue, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_02",
      "hash64": "E85837BB96200CB0",
      "text": "Cela me fait énormément plaisir de te revoir ici,\\nau sommet de la Ligue Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_03",
      "hash64": "E85838BB96200E63",
      "text": "Ta dernière épreuve est on ne peut plus simple :\\ntu dois te battre contre moi.\\c\\nVaincre la Maîtresse en Chef est la condition\\nsine qua non pour réussir cet examen.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 165,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_04",
      "hash64": "E8583DBB962016E2",
      "text": "Cependant, avant d’aller plus loin, permets-moi\\nde te donner un petit avertissement...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_05",
      "hash64": "E8583EBB96201895",
      "text": "J’ai beau être la présidente de la Ligue Pokémon,\\nje m’investis beaucoup quand je combats.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "E8583BBB9620137C",
      "text": "Je ne fais aucun compromis, et je donne tout\\npour m’emparer de la victoire.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_07",
      "hash64": "E8583CBB9620152F",
      "text": "Et en conséquence, peu de candidats viennent\\ntenter cet examen, à mon grand regret...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_08",
      "hash64": "E85841BB96201DAE",
      "text": "Néanmoins, je sens bien que tu es différent[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e...\\nTu me rappelles Maîtresse Menzi, au fond.\\r\\nPour toi non plus, rien ne semble impossible.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_09",
      "hash64": "E85842BB96201F61",
      "text": "Mais trêve de bavardages... Es-tu prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_10",
      "hash64": "E85BBFBB9623299F",
      "text": "Alors, montre-moi toute l’étendue de tes talents ![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_11",
      "hash64": "E85BBEBB962327EC",
      "text": "Quelle puissance extraordinaire !\\nEt cette technique sans faille...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0260_chairman_12",
      "hash64": "E85BC1BB96232D05",
      "text": "Je crois bien que la région de Paldea assiste à la\\nnaissance d’un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e nouve[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]aulle Dresseu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]rse d’exception ![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
